</div></p>
<h3 id="题目描述">题目描述：</h3>
<p>得到的 flag 请包上 flag{} 提交。</p>
<h3 id="密文">密文：</h3>
<p>下载附件，解压得到out.wav</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191047951.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191047951.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<hr>
<h3 id="解题思路">解题思路：</h3>
<p>1、out.wav文件使用了Steghide工具进行隐写。</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Steghide支持以下图像格式：JPEG，BMP，WAV，AU文件。</p>
</blockquote>
<p>安装Steghide命令（Kali）：</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"><span class="line"><span class="cl">apt-get install  steghide
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>使用Steghide查看out.wav文件，发现隐写了一个download.txt文件，提取出来是一条链接。</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">https://share.weiyun.com/5wVTIN3
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191049010.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191049010.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-powershell" data-lang="powershell"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">steghide</span> <span class="n">info</span> <span class="n">out</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="py">wav</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">steghide</span> <span class="n">extract</span> <span class="n">-sf</span> <span class="n">out</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="py">wav</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">cat </span><span class="n">download</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="py">txt</span> 
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>访问该链接，到腾讯微云下载一张图片GUET.png。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191051039.png">
