<p>3、图片中的内容为，经过Unicode编码后的数据。</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="se">\u</span>0034<span class="se">\u</span>0030<span class="se">\u</span>0037<span class="se">\u</span>0030<span class="se">\u</span>000d<span class="se">\u</span>000a<span class="se">\u</span>0031<span class="se">\u</span>0032<span class="se">\u</span>0033<span class="se">\u</span>0034<span class="se">\u</span>000d<span class="se">\u</span>000a
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>Unicode解码：
<a href="https://tool.chinaz.com/tools/unicode.aspx"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unicode编解码</a></p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
